<title>JAPAN: Yahagi Construction -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yahagi Construction -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 33.83		vs	   34.47</p>
<p> Operating	  765    million	  vs	    1.21</p>
<p> Current	    730    million	  vs	  949    million</p>
<p> Net		  575    million	  vs	  750    million</p>
<p> EPS		   13.86 yen	  vs	   18.10 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     42 million	  vs	  41 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yahagi Construction Co Ltd is a construction company belonging to the Nagoya Railroad Co Ltd group.</p>
</text>
